OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy and breezy  
OL,6,Fmorning with outbreaks of rain, the    
OL,7,Frain locally heavy at first. During    
OL,8,Fthe afternoon the rain will tend to    
OL,9,Fpeter out, perhaps with a few brighter 
OL,10,Fbreaks developing. The winds will ease 
OL,11,Ftoo.                                   
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a cloudy evening   
OL,14,Fwith the odd patch of light rain. The  
OL,15,Frain will become heavier and more      
OL,16,Fpersistent from the south overnight,   
OL,17,Fand it will turn breezy.               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
