OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CSaturday:FSaturday will be an          
OL,6,Funsettled day. It will be cloudy and   
OL,7,Fbreezy with outbreaks of rain, some of 
OL,8,Fwhich will be heavy, especially around 
OL,9,Fthe middle of the day.                 
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday  
OL,12,Fwill be much brighter, though a few    
OL,13,Fshowers are possible. Monday looks     
OL,14,Fcloudier, with some wet and windy      
OL,15,Fweather developing into Tuesday.       
OL,16,FTurning milder at the same time.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
